{
  "description": "Requests and what the companion's check of their parameters says (docs/PROTOCOL.md, sections 4 and 7): 'ok', or the error code (and, for bad_request, the field). hello's versions are checked first: a hello without a common version is unsupported_protocol, whatever else it has. These are the checks only: an 'ok' request can still fail on the phone (permission_denied, not_found, ...) or in the session (unknown_token, auth_failed). Unknown parameters are ignored. Revision 1 (companion 0.1.2) adds backup.export's window and backup.ack.",
